{% comment %}
  Por El Deporte — Customer account welcome.

  WHERE THIS GOES
  Shopify admin > Settings > Notifications > Customer notifications >
  Customer account welcome > Edit code. Replace the whole body.
  "Revert to default" restores Shopify's version.

  SUBJECT LINE:
      Welcome to Por El Deporte

  WHAT THIS EMAIL IS FOR
  The only one in this folder with no order attached and nothing going wrong.
  Someone has just chosen to make an account, which makes it the one moment
  where saying what the club actually is belongs — and the one place a "go and
  look at the gear" link is welcome rather than pushy.

  Still kept to one screen. A welcome email that needs scrolling is a brochure.

  VARIABLES
    {{ customer.first_name }}   available here, though the stock template does
                                not use it. Wrapped in a conditional so it
                                degrades to a generic greeting if it is blank.
    {{ shop.email }}

  URLS HARDCODED. {{ shop.url }} resolves to por-el-deporte.myshopify.com, the
  old themed store, which is exactly the wrong place to send a new customer.
  The stock template's only button points there.

  No returns or refunds copy. All sales are final.
{% endcomment %}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Welcome to {{ shop.name }}</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#efe7d3;">

    <div style="display:none; font-size:1px; color:#efe7d3; line-height:1px; max-height:0; max-width:0; opacity:0; overflow:hidden;">
      Your account is live. Por El Deporte means for the sport.
    </div>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#efe7d3;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px 40px 12px;">

          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:600px; background-color:#f7f0de; border:2px solid #171717; border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden;">

            <!-- Crest -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" bgcolor="#171717" style="background-color:#171717; padding:26px 24px;">
                <img src="https://poreldeporte.com/icon-192.png" width="60" height="60" alt="{{ shop.name }}"
                     style="display:block; border:0; width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:14px;" />
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Headline -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:40px 40px 0 40px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#a55032;">
                  Est. 2014 Key Biscayne
                </p>
                <h1 style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:36px; line-height:1.05; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:-0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#171717;">
                  {% if customer.first_name %}Welcome,<br />{{ customer.first_name }}{% else %}You are in{% endif %}
                </h1>
                <p style="margin:18px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#4a463d;">
                  Your account is live. Por El Deporte means for the sport, which
                  is about the size of it: Franco and Marco Viola started the club
                  on Key Biscayne in 2014 for the love of the game, and it became
                  a brotherhood. Play hard, shake hands after, look after the
                  people around you.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:14px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#4a463d;">
                  Everything we make is printed and embroidered to order, and what
                  you buy pays for pitch time, balls and the next match.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- CTA -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:28px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#171717" style="background-color:#171717; border-radius:999px;">
                      <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/collections/all-products"
                         style="display:inline-block; padding:19px 50px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.6px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#f7f0de; text-decoration:none; border-radius:999px;">
                        Shop the gear
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <p style="margin:14px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; color:#6b665b;">
                  or <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/account" style="color:#6b665b;">go to your account</a>
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Follow -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:30px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#a55032; border-radius:12px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:18px 22px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#f7f0de;">
                      Match days, kit drops and whatever happens after the final
                      whistle go up on
                      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/poreldeporte/" style="color:#f7f0de; font-weight:bold;">@poreldeporte</a>.
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Help -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:30px 40px 40px 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:20px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b665b;">
                      Questions about sizing, or anything else? Reply here or write
                      to <a href="mailto:{{ shop.email }}" style="color:#a55032;">{{ shop.email }}</a>
                      and a person will answer.
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>

          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:600px;">
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding:24px 24px 0 24px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:1.7; color:#8a8577;">
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Por El Deporte</a>
                &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/about" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Our story</a>
                &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/policies" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Policies</a>
                <!-- shopify-shop-marketplace-footer -->
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
